SUMMARY:Live Music at the Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live Music at the Melon Ball in Davis \nThis past April\, Jim Bruno\, Rita Hosking\, and Richard March took stage for one of the most amazing and memorable shows ever to hit the Melon Ball stage.  All three return for ROUND 2!  Not to be missed! \n$25 General Admission\nDoors open at 7:00pm\nThis is a BYOB event!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-at-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/RoundRobin2_New-RjQXR2.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
